<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Employee Dashboard | Car Deals</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="role-shell">
        <aside class="role-sidebar">
            <a class="brand-mark" href="/dashboard"><span class="brand-icon">CD</span><span>Car Deals<small>Sales workspace</small></span></a>
            <p class="sidebar-label">My account</p>
            <nav class="sidebar-nav" aria-label="Employee navigation">
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/profile">My profile</a>
            </nav>
            <a class="sidebar-logout logout-button" href="/logout">Log out</a>
        </aside>
        <main class="role-content">
            <div class="role-topline">
                <div>
                    <p class="eyebrow">EMPLOYEE WORKSPACE</p>
                    <h1>Welcome to your workspace</h1>
                    <p class="role-intro">As a sales representative, you help customers find the right vehicle and make every dealership visit a great experience.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="role-date">Sales team</div>
            </div>
            <section class="role-hero manager-hero">
                <div>
                    <span class="hero-kicker">HERE TO HELP CUSTOMERS</span>
                    <h2>Every great deal starts with a conversation.</h2>
                    <p>Keep your account details up to date and support customers throughout their vehicle search.</p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="role-cards" aria-label="Employee account">
                <a class="role-card" href="/profile"><strong>My profile</strong><small>View your account details</small></a>
            </section>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
